'''Murng bats''' can be found inside the [[Chambers of Xeric]] where they can be caught using a [[butterfly net]] in order to obtain a [[raw murng bat (5)]]. They require a [[Hunter]] level of 75 to catch and grant 25 Hunter experience. Once caught, murng bats can be cooked into a [[murng bat (5)]], requiring a [[Cooking]] level of 75.

